      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "<leader>bd           Close / Delete current file buffer\n<leader>bD           Force delete buffer and window\n<leader>bo           Delete all other open buffers\n<leader>bi           Delete invisible / hidden buffers\n<leader>bn / ]b      Next buffer tab (:bnext)\n<leader>bp / [b      Previous buffer tab (:bprevious)\n<S-l> / <S-h>        Fast cycle next / prev buffer tab\n<leader>w            Save current file (:w)\n<leader>q            Quit active window (:q)\n<leader>x            Save and quit window (:x)\n<leader>Q            Force quit all windows (:qa!)\n<leader>tn / tc      New tab (:tabnew) / Close tab (:tabclose)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "<leader>bd           Close / Delete current file buffer\n<leader>bD           Force delete buffer and window\n<leader>bo           Delete all other open buffers\n<leader>bi           Delete invisible / hidden buffers\n<leader>bn / ]b      Next buffer tab (:bnext)\n<leader>bp / [b      Previous buffer tab (:bprevious)\n<S-l> / <S-h>        Fast cycle next / prev buffer tab\n<leader>w            Save current file (:w)\n<leader>q            Quit active window (:q)\n<leader>x            Save and quit window (:x)\n<leader>Q            Force quit all windows (:qa!)\n<leader>tn / tc      New tab (:tabnew) / Close tab (:tabclose)",
      "lineHeight": 1.5
    },
